1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,080
When all the tiles are taken, collecting is over.

2
00:00:03,399 --> 00:00:05,085
Now tiles move to your wall.

3
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:09,129
Every factory display and the centre are empty.

4
00:00:09,449 --> 00:00:10,772
Collecting is over.

5
00:00:11,899 --> 00:00:15,675
Now everyone moves tiles to their wall, all at the same time.

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,445
Go through your pattern lines from top to bottom.

7
00:00:21,649 --> 00:00:23,164
Line one is complete.

8
00:00:23,484 --> 00:00:26,791
Its tile moves to the yellow space in the row beside it.

9
00:00:27,899 --> 00:00:29,307
It scores one point.

10
00:00:29,628 --> 00:00:31,803
The next video shows how to count points.

11
00:00:34,149 --> 00:00:35,878
Line two is complete too.

12
00:00:36,198 --> 00:00:39,739
Its rightmost tile moves to the red space, for one point.

13
00:00:40,059 --> 00:00:42,533
The other red tile goes in the box lid.

14
00:00:43,666 --> 00:00:45,522
Line three is not complete.

15
00:00:45,842 --> 00:00:48,488
Its tiles stay where they are, for the next round.

16
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:52,771
Line four is complete.

17
00:00:53,091 --> 00:00:55,694
One blue tile moves over, for one point.

18
00:00:56,014 --> 00:00:57,976
The other three go in the box lid.

19
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:02,065
Line five is empty, so nothing happens there.

20
00:01:03,950 --> 00:01:05,421
Last, the floor line.

21
00:01:05,742 --> 00:01:09,368
Ana loses one point, and the tile goes in the box lid.

22
00:01:12,383 --> 00:01:14,260
Ben does the same on his board.

23
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:17,524
He had the marker on his floor line, so he keeps it.

24
00:01:18,633 --> 00:01:21,833
Tiles on the wall stay there until the end of the game.

25
00:01:22,966 --> 00:01:23,862
Remember.

26
00:01:24,182 --> 00:01:27,809
Each complete line moves one tile to the wall, and scores.

27
00:01:28,129 --> 00:01:30,689
The rest of that line goes in the box lid.

28
00:01:31,009 --> 00:01:33,846
Lines that aren't complete wait for the next round.

29
00:01:34,166 --> 00:01:36,129
Next: scoring a wall tile.
